Sort `number` and `issuedDay` by JavaScript string ordering and `amountCents` numerically. Equal keys retain original relative order. Paginate after sorting. A page beyond the end has an empty `items` array. Return `page`, `pageSize`, `total`, `pageCount` (`0` for no rows), and newly allocated item objects. The function must never mutate the input array or any input row.

